Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.81,0:00:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They managed to get in...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting couldn't defeat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't strong. They just copied themselves, and Diting fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you just drive them away?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this place for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or get involved with outside affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But doesn't "this place" include Blue Creek?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the mountain is off limits. I must stay in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty, maybe seventy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:29.42,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You make your own life harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you help drive them away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you get your true form back as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:36.01,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead is Mount Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the Grand Dipper Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the Imperial Lockup Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.72,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(785,600)}Blue Creek
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Gen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent him out to run an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:00.08,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sign with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:03.18,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,That won't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it that we always have to wait at doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hole, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this is Suoyu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get inside first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Laojun doesn't intervene,\Nyou can't seal his realm for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that magazine too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I also love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,ONLY comes next week, wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This seal is rather complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It can take a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask you to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How come someone else is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We must fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Space magic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you like at 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That space magic is quite troublesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But it requires a magical artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They can return instantly to where the artifact is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,While attacking, pay attention to the movement of the artifact!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Things I usually do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Read books, prepare the elixir of immortality, surf the internet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the Jade Emperor exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the heavenly court?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Also no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the myths are not true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't make noise inside a temple! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Sun Wukong exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.12,0:02:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Is he super strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he the Great Sage Equal to Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only in the novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You read Journey to the West?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When it was first published.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:48.96,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,The water would have been better...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no eyebrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a deadlock. He has the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:02:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We must use the Firestorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our last resort...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn all this teleportation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They try to use the Firestorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He absorbed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It should cancel ice magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:18.61,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You're quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Another spirit beast! We have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse our intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We are leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:29.54,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Is your name that effective?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, they tricked Diting too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:32.58,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's none.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever seen an immortal use the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you trust us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to ask for your forgiveness again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We will apologize after we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've messed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They fell for the same as Diting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:09.79,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai is outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why did she go outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:12.17,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,To pee...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another entrance we can use!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Another person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a side-scrolling game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No one told us about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop her. You go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope she's no spirit beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:35.79,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my spirit part back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:25.58,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(531,566)}Collection of Twelve
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you came just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you look even less like a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Xiaobai all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:48.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:05:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We surrender, for real this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Summer must be cool with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that whoever forces him to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,will get the Pure Black Elixir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:34.11,Book,,0,0,0,,{\pos(795,1070)}{\fs(45)}{\frx(-20)\frz(10)}Book\Nof\NVows
Dialogue: -1000,0:06:31.93,0:06:34.11,BG_Book,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 716.95 905.52 l 741.71 897.52 751.62 894.48 758.48 892.95 773.33 893.71 787.81 894.86 794.67 895.24 805.33 901.33 810.67 908.57 812.57 933.33 815.24 966.48 819.05 993.52 825.9 1039.24 831.62 1081.9 763.81 1083.05 753.52 1047.24 749.71 1036.19 739.05 987.81 724.19 929.52{\p0}
Dialogue: -1000,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.36,BG_Book,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 716.95 905.52 l 741.71 897.52 751.62 894.48 758.48 892.95 773.33 893.71 787.81 894.86 794.67 895.24 805.33 901.33 810.67 908.57 812.57 933.33 815.24 966.48 819.05 993.52 825.9 1039.24 831.62 1081.9 763.81 1083.05 753.52 1047.24 749.71 1036.19 739.05 987.81 724.19 929.52{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you want to break into the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.09,0:06:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that whoever breaks into the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,will get the Green Soul Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must be quite lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.36,Book,,0,0,0,,{\pos(795,1070)}{\fs(45)}{\frx(-20)\frz(10)}Book\Nof\NVows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A Soul Calling Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept it. I hope you can forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because of Master Lao's vow book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me who should ask for your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we allowed to leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.55,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Xiaohei a spirit too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he only wanted to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He just got a little weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Bidiu, after he transforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So Bidiu's a spirit too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the anatomy of the dumpling mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If Bidiu transformed in the forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you miss him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:07:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He forced himself to transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Inflicted wounds upon wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is it that serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But he'll lose some years of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Say his old wounds made him lose HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this one reduced his HP gauge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With my abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only help him slowly recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm not a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:22.50,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Year 13 of Wuxian
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:22.50,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,No. 239\NThe one hunts the White-Feathered Silkie\NShall get the Silk Phoenix Elixer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:23.80,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an1}No. 237\NThose who collect the inscriptions from all \Nthe memorial arches in town will get the Back Gold elixer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:23.80,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an9}No. 238\NThose who beat me 3 times at Gomoku\Nwill get a Laojun statue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take about a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Should he stay here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give the medicine to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take care of him at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you make so many vows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was very lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortal life must be really boring...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then, it's been decades since my most recent vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I forgot about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Diting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Fairy Qingning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,a wishful dream of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't go out with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you an immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.77,0:09:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so great about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you always an immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm a kind of spirit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone masters the powers of nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they can attain the title of immortal as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So even a human can become an immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, even the mightiest immortal of today was once a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:30.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\pos(707,322)}Xiaobai's worldview
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:30.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\pos(697,465)}Back up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:30.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\pos(701,604)}Refresh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:30.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\pos(699,739)}Recompile
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:30.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\pos(709,872)}Shut Down
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was born hundreds of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,People of today have lost the connection to the powers of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then, I believe the strongest beings yet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,are the people of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but I digress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting rather late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I should send you home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I visit you again someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can bring you anime merchandise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I give this Blue Jade Disc to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it be the seal of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Isn't this a...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man's in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuanli will show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Laojun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll visit you often.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, we have to say goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We teleported!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a cool-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to over use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we... in the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:10:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The house is still flooded,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.64,0:11:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so we came here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.99,0:11:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Bidiu already made friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are few dumpling mice left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he can't find others?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he feels at home in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If he happened to be lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,can we take him home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest is his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun is at home all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, he's bored to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Xiaohei will protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will protect Bidiu and Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you will be a good owner to Bidiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still waiting for you at the border stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just hiding from Xiaobai, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.17,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:34.42,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They care about each other
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and that should be cherished. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:42.96,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Don't get lost again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to leave here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:12:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:00.55,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes against the vow I've made earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:09.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,If he's not willing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:10.82,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,don't push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:13.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Then I take the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose this wasn't your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuxian sent you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:29.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a form of telepathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So others can't hear you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:41.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,No, I decide who I talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so very very cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I have an exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you can under the window and tell me the answers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:49.02,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,It's not meant for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You got used to it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:56.13,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1478,549)}{\fad(1600,0)}Spirit Force
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, how's your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:55.50,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought Bidiu too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.01,0:14:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't eat the house...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Uncle San!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.03,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,When did you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:21.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I seeeee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just four days?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it seem longer to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the software update took a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei is a spirit too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Lil Bro Luo from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:41.54,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm still the younger one...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun sent you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoho, the money's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:53.61,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\pos(915,900)\frz15.0\i1\b1}Got no money
Dialogue: -1000,0:14:49.22,0:14:53.61,BG_Letter,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 747.43 858.86 l 800.57 930.86 833.71 923.43 852.57 944.57 874.29 949.71 919.43 945.71 1004.57 932.57 1069.14 905.71 1047.43 889.14 1035.43 869.14 1036 853.71 1021.71 802.86 893.14 824{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I demolish the village Laojun temple?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:59.36,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780,550)}{\fs(140)}Got no money
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:59.36,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,880)}{\b1}{\fs(70)}Go\NHere
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: -1000,0:14:55.69,0:14:59.36,BG_Letter,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 452.57 388.57 l 755.43 376 1014.86 379.43 1069.71 546.29 638.8 630.4 634.4 634.4 645.6 642.8 688 644.8 644.8 692.8 625.2 709.6 618.4 736.4 544 738.8 540 745.6 536.5 941 434.5 930.5 447.5 718 528 722.67 547.81 731.05 574.1 723.43 616 699.43 647.24 669.71 648.38 652.19 630.86 635.43 638.48 623.24 638.67 591.11 568.44 559.56{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So he wants us to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai! We cook dinner, you can take a bath first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few days it will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, the harvest is already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we'll start training Bidiu about what he can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu, be a good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If Bidiu's not a spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,how come he can turn into a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Spirit" is a name for a certain kind of lifeform,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but they aren't the only ones who can control spririt force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In theory, all living things can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun said that a human can become an immortal too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So even I could control water like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere around us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a legion of invisible beings,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,filling up space.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There are material sprites and soulful sprites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Soulful sprites can merge,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and become bodiless fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They keep changing, absorbing more sprites,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,then combine with material sprites,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and so become beings with bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,These are called spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As they are born from sprites,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,they're naturally better at controlling spirit force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember Master Lao's realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit space is the key to spirit force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By cultivation, attributes of the spirit space can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And those who have no spirit space, they can't even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every living thing has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We absorb sprites with every breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how come I don't know anyone else like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It all depends on innate properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If a human spends decades with mastering ice magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the level they can reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But an ice type spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,is capable of much more from its birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, very few people reached that level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let alone the people today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't Laojun say today's mightiest immortal had been a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He did. I talk about ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.37,0:17:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there are always naturals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The skills depend on the size of the spirit space.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An ordinary person has one about the size of a basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What about yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's about...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the size of a soccer field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd freeze to death in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an icy hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And how big is Laojun's space?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there more than just what we saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact it's just the size of Blue Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mt. Laojun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it in the space?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,On the back of Blue Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine the spirit space is a sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.24,0:17:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Creek is in one side of the sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Under it is Starry Night Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mt. Laojun is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Inbetween, the four palaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,By the physical laws defined by Master Lao,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,each has its own direction of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(449,270)}Xaobai's Worldview
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,408)}Backup
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,543)}Refresh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(449,684)}Rebuild
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(459,813)}Shutdown
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(449,270)}Xaobai's Worldview
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,408)}Backup
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,543)}Refresh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(449,684)}Rebuild
