Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(449,270)}Xaobai's Worldview
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,408)}Backup
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,543)}Refresh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(449,684)}Rebuild
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(459,813)}Shutdown
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:07.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why am I babysitting...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, what's your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:12.02,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'll show you once I'm healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get well soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we'll cover spirit force and subspace abilities in the spirit space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can keep up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll continue slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,These summer nights are so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:34.16,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With Master Lao's medicine, you'll recover in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you leave here then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:39.94,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine not to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have time to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But some troubles may come to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Troubles?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sky Pearl invites trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:56.60,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Somebody's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:47.73,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:47.73,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:52.47,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:52.47,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:57.17,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:57.17,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:03.37,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:03.37,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:09.52,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:09.52,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:14.32,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:14.32,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:19.00,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:19.00,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:25.52,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:25.52,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:36.84,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:36.84,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:42.26,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:42.26,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:47.30,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:47.30,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:58.53,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:58.53,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:04.08,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:04.08,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:10.92,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:10.92,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
